moments. It is much worse at surviving

266
00:14:03,230 --> 00:14:06,590
ordinary ones, because ordinary moments are

267
00:14:06,691 --> 00:14:09,930
exactly where the performance has no audience left

268
00:14:09,970 --> 00:14:13,237
to justify it. The next time someone's affection

269
