276
00:14:34,317 --> 00:14:37,077
be. The goal isn't to become unable to

277
00:14:37,198 --> 00:14:40,618
trust. It's to notice when intensity is being

278
00:14:40,797 --> 00:14:43,837
used as a substitute for time instead of

279
00:14:43,897 --> 00:14:46,197
a natural result of it, and to give

280
00:14:46,237 --> 00:14:49,677
yourself permission to ask for both. Comment the

281
00:14:49,737 --> 00:14:52,517
word love below if you've ever caught yourself

282
00:14:52,577 --> 00:14:55,657
mistaking intensity for intimacy,

283
00:14:55,817 --> 00:14:58,638
or if you now recognize this pattern in

284
00:14:58,697 --> 00:15:01,317
something you lived through. And if you haven't

285
